q("wc-115", I, 3, WC, "Which action by a community would do most to reduce litter in a river?", "Putting out bins and teaching people to use them", [W("Telling people to drink much more water each day", "wrong-idea", "Drinking water does not remove litter."), W("Building much taller houses along the river", "wrong-idea", "This does not stop litter."), W("Using more fertiliser on the farms nearby", "wrong-idea", "More fertiliser makes pollution worse.")], ["Bins and good habits keep litter out of drains and rivers."], None)
