q("wc-203", C, 1, WC, "Set-ups A and B each have a bowl of the same hot water and a plastic sheet. The only difference is the ice on A. After 10 minutes, which set-up has more drops under its sheet and why?", "A, because the ice cools the vapour more", [W("B, because it is warmer under the sheet", "wrong-reason", "A warmer sheet cools the vapour less."), W("A, because the ice adds water to the sheet", "wrong-reason", "The ice does not add water under the sheet."), W("They are the same, because the water is the same", "wrong-reason", "The sheet is colder in A, so more vapour condenses.")], ["The colder sheet in A makes more water vapour condense into drops."], pair)
